#: ../../user/changelog.md:1
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "変更履歴"

#: ../../user/changelog.md:4
msgid ""
"The Phase 1 / Phase 2 module sets are feature-complete in `main`. First "
"publishes (`v0.1.0`, `schema-v0.1.0`, `plugin-fs-v0.1.0`, `plugin-"
"dialog-v0.1.0`) are pending. Each package keeps its own canonical "
"changelog under `packages/<name>/CHANGELOG.md`; this page collects the "
"highlights of the pre-release state across all four packages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:12
msgid "`@rescript-tauri/core` (Unreleased)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:14
msgid ""
"Canonical: [`packages/core/CHANGELOG.md`](https://github.com/Nagatatz"
"/rescript-tauri/blob/main/packages/core/CHANGELOG.md)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:16 ../../user/changelog.md:58
#: ../../user/changelog.md:79 ../../user/changelog.md:97
#: ../../user/changelog.md:116
msgid "Added"
msgstr "Added"

#: ../../user/changelog.md:18
msgid ""
"12 Phase-1 modules across `packages/core`, every one paired with a hand-"
"written `.resi`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:20
msgid ""
"`Core` — IPC bridge: `Raw.invoke`, typed `Command` (`make` / `invoke` / "
"`invokeExn`), streaming `Channel`, `convertFileSrc`. Exposes a public "
"`decoder<'value>` type alias for downstream packages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:24
msgid ""
"`Event` — typed pub/sub with `make`, `listen`, `once`, `emit`, `emitTo`, "
"and an `eventTarget` discriminator. Listener callbacks receive "
"`result<event<'payload>, string>` so decode failures are explicit."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:28
msgid ""
"`Window` — opaque handle plus ~80 instance / static methods (theme, "
"cursorIcon, monitor helpers, drag/resize, six `on*` handlers, ...)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:31
msgid ""
"`Webview` — opaque handle, 14 instance methods, and a `dragDropEvent` "
"variant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:33
msgid ""
"`WebviewWindow` — combined Window + Webview surface with zero-cost "
"`asWindow` / `asWebview` casts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:35
msgid ""
"`Menu` — full menu hierarchy (`MenuItem`, `CheckMenuItem`, "
"`IconMenuItem`, `PredefinedMenuItem`, `Submenu`, `Menu`) with an "
"`itemKind` variant and a `predefinedItem` variant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:38
msgid ""
"`Tray` — `TrayIcon` opaque handle + `trayIconEvent` variant (`Click` / "
"`DoubleClick` / `Enter` / `Move` / `Leave`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:40
msgid "`Path` — 31 path helpers + `BaseDirectory` enum."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:41
msgid ""
"`App` — `getName`, `getVersion`, `getTauriVersion`, `defaultWindowIcon`, "
"`setTheme`, ... (stable subset)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:43
msgid ""
"`Image` — RGBA-image opaque handle with `fromPath`, `fromBytes`, `new_`, "
"`rgba`, `size`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:45
msgid ""
"`Dpi` — `LogicalSize`, `PhysicalSize`, `LogicalPosition`, "
"`PhysicalPosition`, `Size`, `Position` as opaque JS-class bindings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:48
msgid "`Mocks` — `mockIPC`, `mockWindows`, `clearMocks`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:49
msgid ""
"`Tauri.res` umbrella module re-exporting `Core`, `Event`, `Window`, "
"`Webview`, `WebviewWindow` (PRD §10 row 1, confirmed 2026-05-09)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:51
msgid ""
"Four buildable examples gated by 3-OS CI: `hello-world`, `window-"
"management`, `ipc-typed`, `streaming-ipc`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:54
msgid "`@rescript-tauri/schema` (Unreleased)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:56
msgid ""
"Canonical: [`packages/schema/CHANGELOG.md`](https://github.com/Nagatatz"
"/rescript-tauri/blob/main/packages/schema/CHANGELOG.md)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:60
msgid ""
"`Schema.fromSchemas` — typed `Core.Command.t<'args, 'result>` from a "
"single `S.t<'args>` + `S.t<'result>` pair."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:62
msgid ""
"`Schema.channelFromSchema` / `Schema.eventFromSchema` — schema-decoded "
"`Core.Channel` and `Event` handles."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:64
msgid ""
"`Schema.toDecoder` — lower-level `S.t<'value>` → `Core.decoder<'value>` "
"helper."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:66
msgid "`Schema.S` re-exports `RescriptSchema.S` for ergonomic access."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:67
msgid ""
"Runnable example [`examples/ipc-typed-with-"
"schema`](https://github.com/Nagatatz/rescript-tauri/tree/main/examples"
"/ipc-typed-with-schema) pairing against `examples/ipc-typed/` to compare "
"Layer 2 vs Layer 3."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:71
msgid ""
"`peerDependencies`: `@rescript-tauri/core ^0.1.0`, `rescript-schema "
"^9.0.0`. `rescript-struct` is intentionally unsupported (RFC-0002 §2.1)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:75
msgid "`@rescript-tauri/plugin-fs` (Unreleased)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:77
msgid ""
"Canonical: [`packages/plugin-"
"fs/CHANGELOG.md`](https://github.com/Nagatatz/rescript-"
"tauri/blob/main/packages/plugin-fs/CHANGELOG.md)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:81
msgid ""
"14 single-shot filesystem functions (`readTextFile` / `writeTextFile` / "
"`readFile` / `writeFile` / `exists` / `remove` / `rename` / `mkdir` / "
"`readDir` / `stat` / `lstat` / `truncate` / `copyFile` / `size`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:85
msgid ""
"`PluginFs.BaseDirectory` re-exported from `@rescript-tauri/core`'s "
"`Path.BaseDirectory.t`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:87
msgid ""
"Runnable example [`examples/plugin-fs-demo`](https://github.com/Nagatatz"
"/rescript-tauri/tree/main/examples/plugin-fs-demo) exercising the full "
"surface inside the `$APPLOCALDATA` sandbox."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:90
msgid ""
"`peerDependencies`: `@rescript-tauri/core ^0.1.0`, `@tauri-apps/plugin-fs"
" ^2.5.0`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:93
msgid "`@rescript-tauri/plugin-dialog` (Unreleased)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:95
msgid ""
"Canonical: [`packages/plugin-"
"dialog/CHANGELOG.md`](https://github.com/Nagatatz/rescript-"
"tauri/blob/main/packages/plugin-dialog/CHANGELOG.md)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:99
msgid ""
"8 native-dialog functions (`openFile` / `openFiles` / `openDirectory` / "
"`openDirectories` / `save` / `message` / `ask` / `confirm`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:102
msgid ""
"The TypeScript-level conditional return type of upstream's "
"`open(options)` is unrolled into four ReScript functions so the result "
"type stays static."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:105
msgid ""
"Runnable example [`examples/plugin-dialog-"
"demo`](https://github.com/Nagatatz/rescript-tauri/tree/main/examples"
"/plugin-dialog-demo) driving every public function from one button each."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:108
msgid ""
"`peerDependencies`: `@rescript-tauri/core ^0.1.0`, `@tauri-apps/plugin-"
"dialog ^2.7.0`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:111
msgid "Repository-level updates"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:113
msgid ""
"These changes affect the monorepo as a whole and don't belong to a single"
" package CHANGELOG."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/changelog.md:118
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"GitHub Actions workflows: per-package `tests-{core,schema,plugin-fs"
",plugin-dialog}-{types,runtime}.yml`, `examples-build` matrix covering 7 "
"examples on Linux / macOS / Windows, `lint-format` (Biome), `tests-"
"coverage` (vitest v8), `compat-tauri-latest` and `compat-rescript-"
"prerelease` nightlies, `release.yml` recognizing `v*` / `schema-v*` / "
"`plugin-fs-v*` / `plugin-dialog-v*` tag prefixes."
msgstr ""

